; version_proxy.def -- export-forwarding table for the proxy version.dll.
;
; Every export of the REAL version.dll is forwarded verbatim to "versionorig.dll"
; (a byte copy of the real Proton/Wine version.dll placed next to the game exe by
; setup_proxy.sh). The proxy therefore adds ZERO behavior to version.dll itself --
; its only job is to get our DllMain (dllmain.c) executed inside the game process.
;
; The 16 names + ordinals below were extracted from the actual Proton prefix
; version.dll for appid 2634890 (system32\version.dll). If a future Proton build
; changes the set, regenerate with gen_def.py. VerLanguageNameA/W are themselves
; forwarders to kernel32 inside version.dll; chaining through versionorig is fine.
;
; NOTE: LIBRARY name intentionally omitted -- the output filename (version.dll)
; is what the loader keys on; an explicit "LIBRARY version" is not required and
; avoids any ordinal/name-decoration surprises with mingw ld.

EXPORTS
GetFileVersionInfoA=versionorig.GetFileVersionInfoA @1
GetFileVersionInfoExA=versionorig.GetFileVersionInfoExA @2
GetFileVersionInfoExW=versionorig.GetFileVersionInfoExW @3
GetFileVersionInfoSizeA=versionorig.GetFileVersionInfoSizeA @4
GetFileVersionInfoSizeExA=versionorig.GetFileVersionInfoSizeExA @5
GetFileVersionInfoSizeExW=versionorig.GetFileVersionInfoSizeExW @6
GetFileVersionInfoSizeW=versionorig.GetFileVersionInfoSizeW @7
GetFileVersionInfoW=versionorig.GetFileVersionInfoW @8
VerFindFileA=versionorig.VerFindFileA @9
VerFindFileW=versionorig.VerFindFileW @10
VerInstallFileA=versionorig.VerInstallFileA @11
VerInstallFileW=versionorig.VerInstallFileW @12
VerLanguageNameA=versionorig.VerLanguageNameA @13
VerLanguageNameW=versionorig.VerLanguageNameW @14
VerQueryValueA=versionorig.VerQueryValueA @15
VerQueryValueW=versionorig.VerQueryValueW @16
